|---|---|---|
| src/watch.rs | 3472 | 3532 (+60 — 60% of its grace band, one bad day from fatal) |
| src/repl.rs | 3357 | 3358 |
| src/commands_spawn.rs | 3991 | 4099 (grown by step 1, updated in the same diff) |

